{"title":"When In Rome","link":"https://kottke.org/25/06/when-in-rome","date":1750337154000,"content":"\n        <p>Ok, having been all over the western Mediterranean for the past two weeks, I’m back. <em>*sigh*</em> Here, without comment or context (I know, I know), are some of the things I saw:</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-06.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-06.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-06.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2312\" alt=\"statue of a veiled woman\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2311\" alt=\"detail of Caravaggio's Judith Beheading Holofernes\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2312\" alt=\"black and white photo of a Roman temple\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2312\" alt=\"massive cranes in a shipyard\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2312\" alt=\"a bright red one-seater car on the streets of Rome\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-05.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-05.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-05.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2312\" alt=\"Bernini sculpture of David with his slingshot\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-07.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-07.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-07.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2312\" alt=\"brilliantly blue Mediterranean Sea\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-08.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-08.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-08.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2312\" alt=\"detail of Bernini's sculpture Apollo and Daphne\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-09.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-09.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-09.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2312\" alt=\"detail of letters carved into stone\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-10.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-10.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-10.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2312\" alt=\"a shipyard filled with shipping containers\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-11.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-11.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-11.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2312\" alt=\"a view of a church dome &amp; steeple through the foliage\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-12.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-12.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-12.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2310\" alt=\"a statue of an angelic woman\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-13.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-13.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/rome-13.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"2312\" alt=\"detail of letters carved into stone\" /></p>\n\n<p>Not pictured: a bunch of amazing food we ate over the course of the trip.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Jason%20Kottke\">Jason Kottke</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Rome\">Rome</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/travel\">travel</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/06/when-in-rome\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"2d24cb7921ee86095a747f215d5c981dee3c9648f086c4d3ea6b13404ed102ba","category":"Sites"}